{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095500/extras/66021b76540c1f8e0cdb3c556fd148e1.avif?t=1768775295\" width=1560 height=818 /></span><strong>Menacetide</strong> is a top-down twin-stick shooter survival game where every second counts. You fight against an Alien invasion that overwhelmed Earth's defenses, on a Hail-Mary mission to beat them down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather fuel to prepare your jump to the next sector, inching closer and closer to the Enemy's home planet. Every minute you linger, the strength of their armada grows. On your way, collect resources to upgrade your ship with crucial new weapon systems and defenses. Visit Alien worlds and unravel the lore behind the Menace Tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Menacetide</strong> is optimized for <strong>Steam Deck</strong> and plays well with <i>Keyboard&amp;Mouse</i> or <i>Gamepad</i> alike.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4095500?t=1768775295","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095500/603fcbce6fc7b41fda3e2ddf267dcdc7cd2bd8a5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768775295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095500/b0158519abeeb2c225143af01f50581eab077bc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768775295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4095500/b0158519abeeb2c225143af01f50581eab077bc5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768775295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"cont